    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_CrashCrashCrasherWake",
      "en_US": [
        "The ring is my roiling sea. ♫\n",
        "The towering waves shaped me.\r",
        "Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake!\n",
        "Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake!\r",
        "I’m the tidal wave of power to wash\n",
        "you away!\r",
        "Put out the fire, Crasher Wake!\n",
        "Run from electricity, Crasher Wake!\r",
        "Ah, ah, aaaah!\n",
        "The ring is my sea. ♫\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sur le ring, pareil à un loup de mer, ♫\n",
        "les flots ont façonné mon âme\f",
        "guerrière.\r",
        "Bang! C’est moi Lovis le Teigneux!\n",
        "Bang! C’est moi Lovis le Teigneux!\r",
        "La déferlante toute puissante prête à\n",
        "vous submerger!\r",
        "J’éteins les flammes les plus ardentes!\n",
        "Mais j’évite l’électricité mordante!\r",
        "Ah, ah, aaaah! Je me déchaîne sur le\n",
        "ring comme une tempête en mer. ♫\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_YoureChallengingTheGymLeader",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, dude and young lady!\n",
        "You’re challenging the Gym Leader,\f",
        "are you?\r",
        "Let me tell you now, she’s young, but\n",
        "she’s a born genius.\r",
        "I tried training with her, and I was\n",
        "stunned by how tough she was!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, les jeunes!\n",
        "Vous allez défier le Champion d’Arène,\f",
        "n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "Je vous préviens, elle est jeune, mais\n",
        "c’est un génie.\r",
        "J’ai essayé de m’entraîner à ses côtés,\n",
        "et sa force m’a laissé sans voix!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_ImCrasherWakeOfPastoriaGym",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoops!\n",
        "I’d better tell you who I am!\r",
        "I’m the triple-threat Gym Leader in\n",
        "Pokémon, wrestling, and song.\r",
        "I’m Crasher Wake of Pastoria Gym!\n",
        "We’ll meet again!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oups!\n",
        "Je ferais mieux de me présenter!\r",
        "Je suis Champion d’Arène, et expert en\n",
        "Pokémon, en catch et en chant.\r",
        "Lovis le Teigneux, de Verchamps!\n",
        "On se reverra!\r"
      ]
    },
