    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_ThisIsTheAwesomeWarehouse",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: This is the awesome Team\n",
        "Galactic’s awesome warehouse!\r",
        "A little kid like you should be playing\n",
        "at the Pokémon Gym.\r",
        "After all, the Gym Leader happens to\n",
        "be a kid just like you!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 2: C’est le méga hangar de la\n",
        "méga Team Galaxie!\r",
        "Les minus dans ton genre feraient mieux\n",
        "d’aller jouer dans une Arène...\r",
        "Après tout, le Champion n’est encore\n",
        "qu’un bébé, tout comme toi!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_YouveBroughtYourBuddy",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: What? Now you’ve brought\n",
        "your buddy along so you can get your\f",
        "Pokédex back?\r",
        "We’ll be just as happy to send both\n",
        "of you crying home to your mommies!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 1: Quoi? Tu as ramené\n",
        "du renfort pour récupérer\f",
        "ton Pokédex?\r",
        "On va se faire un plaisir de vous\n",
        "renvoyer chez vos mamans!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_WellTakeYouOn",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: You’re trying to get the\n",
        "Pokédex back from us?\r",
        "Not when we, Team Galactic, can make\n",
        "so much better use of it!\r",
        "But, OK, guarding the warehouse\n",
        "does get boring!\r",
        "We’ll take you on two-on-two!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 2: Vous avez l’intention\n",
        "de récupérer le Pokédex?\r",
        "Allons, vous n’y pensez pas, la Team\n",
        "Galaxie en fera meilleur usage!\r",
        "Mais j’admets qu’on s’ennuie\n",
        "vite à surveiller le hangar!\r",
        "Nous combattrons en duo!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_AwwThatStinks",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Aww, that stinks!\n",
        "Our Pokémon are chumps!\r",
        "We should get new ones from\n",
        "headquarters.\r",
        "Humph! Who cares about some\n",
        "Pokédex anyway?\r",
        "Team Galactic’s going to own\n",
        "all the Pokémon in the world...\f",
        "No, in the universe!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 1: Aaaah, c’est nul!\n",
        "Nos Pokémon sont des mauviettes!\r",
        "On devrait en prendre de nouveaux\n",
        "au quartier général.\r",
        "Pfff! De toute façon, on s’en\n",
        "fiche bien des Pokédex!\r",
        "La Team Galaxie aura bientôt tous\n",
        "les Pokémon du monde à sa botte...\f",
        "Tous les Pokémon de l’univers, même!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_TakeYourPokedex",
      "en_US": [
