    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_WeWillRunLikeGrunts",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: Those things we had in\n",
        "the warehouse’ve already been moved\f",
        "to Pastoria City anyway...\r",
        "So, we’ll say “You’ll get yours!”\n",
        "And run like the grunts we are.\r"
