      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, thank you,\n",
        "sincerely.\r",
        "I would’ve been lost without my\n",
        "Pokédex.\r",
        "It’s indispensable for helping Prof.\n",
        "Rowan with his studies.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what are you going\n",
