    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_YouInsultMeToMyFace",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: You insult me to my face?\n",
        "How very uncouth of you.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Beladonis: Vous osez vous exprimer ainsi\n",
        "en ma présence? Quelle grossièreté!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_DawnIShouldBeGoingNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I’m terribly sorry.\r",
        "Team Galactic took my Pokédex, so I was\n",
        "very irritated...\r",
        "I just blurted it out...\r",
        "...I should be going now.\n",
        "Be wary of Team Galactic.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Je suis désolée.\r",
        "La Team Galaxie m’avait volé mon\n",
        "Pokédex, je suis furieuse...\r",
        "C’est sorti comme ça...\r",
        "Bon, je vous laisse.\n",
        "Méfiez-vous de la Team Galaxie.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_LucasIllBeGoingNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Oh, sorry. Honestly.\r",
        "I was upset from having my Pokédex\n",
        "ripped off by Team Galactic.\r",
        "I didn’t even think when I spoke up.\r",
        "I’ll be going now.\n",
        "Uh... Watch out for Team Galactic.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Oh, désolé.\r",
        "J’étais dégoûté que la Team Galaxie\n",
        "m’ait piqué mon Pokédex.\r",
        "J’ai parlé sans réfléchir.\r",
        "Je vous laisse. Et euh...\n",
        "Méfiez-vous de la Team Galaxie.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCity_Text_WellTakeALook",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: It is of no matter.\r",
        "Of more interest is the criminal\n",
        "behavior of the Team Galactic.\r",
        "They attempt to steal the belongings of\n",
        "a child?\r",
        "The scale of their criminality, it seems\n",
        "rather minuscule.\r",
        "The triviality of their action makes\n",
        "them more sinister, perhaps.\r",
        "Their warehouse needs investigation.\n",
        "Come with me, and we’ll take a look!\r"
